:: HusbandReturns
<h2 class="story-title">The Husband Returns</h2>

The sethani returned to the bridal chamber just in time to see the seth taking off his turban.

Who could understand the leelas of Bhagwan?

The seth turned around, unable to stop staring. Where had the sethani been all dressed up like this? His brow throbbed with foreboding.

He smiled as he asked: "You must have had word of my imminent arrival. A wife wouldn't dress up so if she hadn't received news of her husband's return... would she?"

The sethani stood frozen, her heart pounding.

**What should she do?**

[[Tell him the complete truth|ConfessionToHusband]]
[[Make up an excuse about expecting his return|LieToHusband]]